; An --account-rewrite or --payee-rewrite option line in a journal file
; belongs to the report, like the same option given on the command line,
; so its rule is tried before the rules that account-rewrite and
; payee-rewrite directives declare, even when the directives come first.
; The journal is in the .dat file, which each command names with -f.

test -f test/regress/rewrite-option-line-precedence.dat bal --flat
              $12.00  Expenses:Food
             $-12.00  Purse
--------------------
                   0
end test

test -f test/regress/rewrite-option-line-precedence.dat reg Food
24-Jan-05 Market                Expenses:Food                $12.00       $12.00
end test
